{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S01、S05等短屏里同时摆出的感受文字偏密，快速扫读不如X轻松。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y把关键心理转折放大加亮，即使边听边扫、不读完小字，也更容易抓住他为什么靠近、退缩、重新坦白。按音乐时机出现的感受，以及反复出现的水波、漂浮、失重和落定，让情绪细节与前后变化更连贯、更具体。X的短词容易扫到，但常常只是并列的感觉标签，观众得自己补出它们和人物心理、音乐变化之间的联系；Y的优势也不等于每句感受都能被读到。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f17bb9d8-bb57-478a-9036-cf19e3099379", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T064523599322Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:46:39.168197+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f099b91796f33d0ca46c83fe0397759f84ed9d25f2ec7341fdde82b614ad7df", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"